# Turn off Wi-Fi power saving on the Pi Zero W (KDS-3kd). With it on, latency to
# the device varied far more (up to 69 ms against 12 ms off), which hurts incoming
# audio streams. The speaker is mains powered, so the extra power draw is small.
ACTION=="add", SUBSYSTEM=="net", KERNEL=="wlan0", RUN+="/usr/sbin/iw dev %k set power_save off"
